ification which include physiochemical tests like alcohol quantity, fixed acidity, volatile acidity, determination of density, pH and more. The main goal of this machine learning project is to build a machine learning model to predict the quality of wines by exploring their various chemical properties. Wine quality dataset consists of 4898 observations with 11 independent and 1 dependent variable.","topics":[],"score":2237,"global_rank":151403},{"name":"harshnagoriya/Housing-Price-Prediction","owner":"harshnagoriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Housing-Price-Prediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"House prices increase every year, so there is a need for a system to predict house prices in the future. House price prediction can help the developer determine the selling price of a house and can help the customer to arrange the right time to purchase a house. There are three factors that influence the price of a house which include physical conditions, concept and location. This project aims to predict house prices. Proudly created by Harsh Nagoriya","topics":[],"score":2237,"global_rank":151404},{"name":"harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","owner":"harshnagoriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The aim of this project is to classify iris flowers among three species (setosa, versicolor or virginica) from measurements of length and width of sepals and petals.","topics":[],"score":2237,"global_rank":151405},{"name":"TheAlexGrimes30/Neural-Networks","owner":"TheAlexGrimes30","html_url":"https://github.com/TheAlexGrimes30/Neural-Networks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2237,"global_rank":151419},{"name":"pbuggaveeti28/ML-Colab","owner":"pbuggaveeti28","html_url":"https://github.com/